Package: opkg-tools
Architecture: all
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python, python-commodity
Description: Tools to generate OpenWrt packages
 Some basic tools to generate and compile OpenWrt opkg packages. It
 provides a dh_make like tool (called opkg-make) and a builder tool,
 called opkg-build.
